usage: cascade.py [-h] --identity IDENTITY [--base BASE] [--weights WEIGHTS]
                  [--certs CERTS] [--allow-uncertified]
                  [--tokenizer-dir TOKENIZER_DIR] [--device DEVICE]
                  [--route {head,cascade}] [--model MODEL]
                  [--max-tokens MAX_TOKENS] [--items ITEMS] [--state STATE]
                  [--question QUESTION] [--options OPTIONS [OPTIONS ...]]
                  [--criteria CRITERIA [CRITERIA ...]]
                  [--cached-shards CACHED_SHARDS [CACHED_SHARDS ...]]
                  [--policy POLICY] [--min-confidence MIN_CONFIDENCE]
                  [--min-margin MIN_MARGIN]
                  [--max-normalized-entropy MAX_NORMALIZED_ENTROPY]
                  [--model-identity MODEL_IDENTITY]
                  [--model-config MODEL_CONFIG] --out OUT

Decision CLI: head-only or head-then-decode cascade, live or from cached archives.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --identity IDENTITY   identity JSON recorded on the serving host
  --base BASE
  --weights WEIGHTS     directory with best.pt and norm.npz
  --certs CERTS         published certificate directory
  --allow-uncertified   explicitly run a backbone with no matching
                        certificate; results are stamped uncertified
  --tokenizer-dir TOKENIZER_DIR
                        served model tokenizer directory (tokenizer.json +
                        chat_template.jinja)
  --device DEVICE
  --route {head,cascade}
  --model MODEL         served model name for the decode fallback (default:
                        from identity)
  --max-tokens MAX_TOKENS
  --items ITEMS         JSONL of prepared decision items
  --state STATE         single item: state (JSON or free text)
  --question QUESTION   single item: question
  --options OPTIONS [OPTIONS ...]
                        single item: option texts
  --criteria CRITERIA [CRITERIA ...]
                        single item: OPTION=description pairs
  --cached-shards CACHED_SHARDS [CACHED_SHARDS ...]
                        replay archived feature shards instead of live readout
  --policy POLICY       policy JSON selected on dev only
  --min-confidence MIN_CONFIDENCE
  --min-margin MIN_MARGIN
  --max-normalized-entropy MAX_NORMALIZED_ENTROPY
  --model-identity MODEL_IDENTITY
                        optional backbone artifact identity for a strict check
  --model-config MODEL_CONFIG
                        optional backbone config used by the serving host
  --out OUT
